#######################################################
# HOME PAGE (home.html)
#######################################################

msgid "Less stress with shared expenses"
msgstr "Minder stress bij gedeelde uitgaven"

msgid "Split expenses fairly"
msgstr "Uitgaven eerlijk verdelen"

msgid "with friends, flatmates or on trips."
msgstr "met vrienden, huisgenoten of op reis."

msgid ""
"Track balances per group, trip or flat. One clear overview of who paid "
"what – without Excel, arguments or forgotten repayments."
msgstr ""
"Hou saldi bij per groep, trip of kot. Eén duidelijk overzicht van wie wat "
"betaalde – zonder Excel, discussies of vergeten terugbetalingen."

msgid "Sign up for free"
msgstr "Registreer gratis"

msgid "I already have an account"
msgstr "Ik heb al een account"

msgid "Split expenses in seconds"
msgstr "Uitgaven splitten in seconden"

msgid "Perfect for trips, flats & teams"
msgstr "Perfect voor trips, kot & ploegen"

msgid "Works on laptop, tablet and phone"
msgstr "Werkt op laptop, tablet en smartphone"

msgid "Trip"
msgstr "Reis"

msgid "Weekend with friends"
msgstr "Weekend met vrienden"

msgid "5 friends · 18 expenses"
msgstr "5 vrienden · 18 uitgaven"

msgid "Flights"
msgstr "Vluchten"

msgid "Apartment"
msgstr "Appartement"

msgid "Food & drinks"
msgstr "Eten & drinken"

msgid "Student flat Ghent"
msgstr "Studentenkot Gent"

msgid "still to be paid this month"
msgstr "nog te betalen deze maand"

msgid "Team fund"
msgstr "Ploegkas"

msgid "still open"
msgstr "nog open"

msgid "How does FairSplit+ work?"
msgstr "Hoe werkt FairSplit+?"

msgid "Trips with friends"
msgstr "Reizen met vrienden"

msgid ""
"Create a group for each trip and keep all bookings, groceries and "
"activities nicely organised."
msgstr ""
"Maak een groep per trip en houd alle boekingen, boodschappen en "
"activiteiten netjes bij."

msgid "Home or flat expenses"
msgstr "Huis- of kotuitgaven"

msgid ""
"From rent and energy bills to groceries: everyone instantly sees who "
"paid for what."
msgstr ""
"Van huur en energie tot boodschappen: iedereen ziet meteen wie wat "
"betaalde."

msgid "Teams & clubs"
msgstr "Teams & clubs"

msgid ""
"Use FairSplit+ for team funds, weekends away or events with your club or "
"society."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik FairSplit+ voor ploegkassen, weekendjes weg of events met je "
"vereniging."

msgid "Fair settlement"
msgstr "Eerlijke afrekening"

msgid ""
"Automatic calculation of balances per person – simple, transparent and "
"argument-free."
msgstr ""
"Automatische berekening van saldi per persoon – simpel, transparant en "
"discussie-vrij."

